   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The Last Wait. You're in a\nhospital bed, waiting for\nyour daughter to arrive\nbefore you go.",
   "start": 10.741,
   "duration": 5.427,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And the room keeps\nchanging while you wait.",
   "start": 16.418,
   "duration": 2.579,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Two point four gigabytes,\nUnreal. Nearly all of it\nsealed in one container.",
   "start": 19.247,
